/godot/pull/116024.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-03T16:54:47Z"},"body":"https://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v1.0.0\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a big update spanning multiple areas in the ThorVG codebase; as such, having simply made it compile, there seem to be a few bugs left to squash (more on that later on), some of which were probably introduced by me.\r\n\r\nFor those able and willing to help get this update through to Godot, here are some helpful links for your consideration:\r\n\r\n- blog post about the v1.0.0 release: https://www.thorvg.org/post/thorvg-v1-0-a-new-generation-released\r\n- ThorVG API Changes: v0.15 → v1.0: https://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/wiki/ThorVG-API-Changes:-v0.15-%E2%86%92-v1.0\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI removed patches 2 and 3 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\n- Patch 2 seems to have been, in an analogous way, merged upstream, and thus no longer needed,\r\n- Seems to me like patch 3 isn't needed anymore, as all the `.cpp` files that had `cstdlib` inserted into them import it through `tvgCommon.h`.\r\n\r\nI may be wrong about the above justifications, of course, so please correct me if that's the case.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n~~Now, Godot compiles and works, but SVGs are all kinds of funky:~~\r\n\r\n~~<img width=\"1154\" height=\"832\" alt=\"thorvg_1_0_0\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b6a5d3b-1baa-4f9b-bd5a-ee3bc9f4bcee\" />~~\r\n\r\n~~and then, there is also this:~~\r\n\r\n```\r\nGodot Engine v4.7.dev.custom_build.47802033a (2026-02-07 19:40:59 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\r\nVulkan 1.4.312 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti\r\n\r\nWARNING: 1 RID of type \"CanvasItem\" was leaked.\r\n     at: _free_rids (servers\\rendering\\renderer_canvas_cull.cpp:2690)\r\nWARNING: ObjectDB instances leaked at exit (run with --verbose for details).\r\n     at: cleanup (core\\object\\object.cpp:2641)\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nBoth of the above issues have been fixed (the latter of which was a project issue, not engine-specific 😜).\r\n\r\nAlso:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v1.0.1\r\nhttps://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v1.0.2\r\nhttps://github.com/thorvg/thorvg/releases/tag/v1.0.3\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}